flowchart TD
    A[Answer: correct, responseTime] --> ADE[Adaptive Difficulty Engine]
    S[Current Streak] --> ADE
    UR[userRating] --> ADE
    ER[exerciseRating] --> ADE

    ADE -->|"E = expected(userRating, exerciseRating)"| CALC[Calcular S y K]
    CALC --> UPD_U[nextUserRating]
    CALC --> UPD_E[nextExerciseRating]

    UPD_U --> POOL[Exercise Pool]
    UPD_E --> POOL

    POOL -->|filtra por rating +/- banda| NEXT[Siguiente Ejercicio]